        <UserObject label="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 60px;&quot;&gt;khi mcu khởi động hoặc chạy ổn định thì instuction có được copy từ flash lên ram không hay mỗi lần đọc instruction thì CPU phải vào flash để đọc&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center justify-between&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex min-w-0 items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)&quot;&gt;Thought for a couple of seconds&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; data-rtl-flip=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;icon-xs&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;9cca5a72-9634-417e-b1e2-75d69f3d2541&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;101&quot;&gt;Tùy MCU và cách firmware/linker được cấu hình. Nhưng với &lt;strong data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;75&quot;&gt;MCU thông dụng&lt;/strong&gt;, câu trả lời ngắn gọn là:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;103&quot; data-end=&quot;274&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;103&quot; data-end=&quot;230&quot;&gt;Thông thường instruction không được copy toàn bộ từ Flash lên RAM. CPU thường fetch instruction trực tiếp từ Flash để chạy.&lt;/strong&gt; Cách này gọi là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;247&quot; data-end=&quot;273&quot;&gt;XIP — Execute In Place&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;276&quot; data-end=&quot;279&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1ogqtew&quot; data-start=&quot;281&quot; data-end=&quot;337&quot;&gt;1. Khi MCU vừa khởi động, CPU đọc instruction từ đâu?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;339&quot; data-end=&quot;414&quot;&gt;Sau reset, CPU bắt đầu chạy từ một địa chỉ cố định gọi là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;397&quot; data-end=&quot;413&quot;&gt;reset vector&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;416&quot; data-end=&quot;449&quot;&gt;Ví dụ với nhiều MCU ARM Cortex-M:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;451&quot; data-end=&quot;522&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Flash bắt đầu tại: 0x08000000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAM bắt đầu tại:   0x20000000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;524&quot; data-end=&quot;546&quot;&gt;Trong Flash thường có:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;548&quot; data-end=&quot;685&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;0x08000000: Initial Stack Pointer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;0x08000004: Reset_Handler address&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;0x08000008: NMI_Handler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;0x0800000C: HardFault_Handler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;687&quot; data-end=&quot;697&quot;&gt;Khi reset:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;699&quot; data-end=&quot;836&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU đọc vector table trong Flash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lấy địa chỉ Reset_Handler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nhảy tới Reset_Handler trong Flash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bắt đầu chạy startup code&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;893&quot;&gt;Tức là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;892&quot;&gt;ngay từ đầu CPU đã đọc instruction từ Flash&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;895&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;fuspbg&quot; data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;949&quot;&gt;2. Có copy instruction từ Flash lên RAM không?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1fpen8d&quot; data-start=&quot;951&quot; data-end=&quot;992&quot;&gt;Thông thường: không copy toàn bộ code&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;994&quot; data-end=&quot;1032&quot;&gt;Code của bạn thường nằm trong section:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1034&quot; data-end=&quot;1051&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=