nt q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;kiểm tra boot mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;kiểm tra fuse/option bytes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;kiểm tra bảo mật&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;tìm boot device&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;khởi tạo giao tiếp nạp firmware&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;xác thực image nếu có secure boot&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3688&quot; data-end=&quot;3768&quot;&gt;Nếu mỗi watchdog reset đều chạy full BootROM flow thì khởi động lại sẽ chậm hơn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3770&quot; data-end=&quot;3861&quot;&gt;Trong nhiều MCU nhỏ, app cần reset nhanh và quay lại điều khiển hệ thống càng sớm càng tốt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3863&quot; data-end=&quot;3866&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1ukpxup&quot; data-start=&quot;3868&quot; data-end=&quot;3922&quot;&gt;Lý do 2: Watchdog reset thường chỉ để phục hồi app&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3924&quot; data-end=&quot;3970&quot;&gt;Watchdog dùng để xử lý trường hợp app bị treo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3972&quot; data-end=&quot;3984&quot;&gt;Mục tiêu là:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3986&quot; data-end=&quot;4055&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full bo