/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5224&quot; data-end=&quot;5336&quot;&gt;Nếu watchdog reset mà vào BootROM và BootROM chờ command, sản phẩm có thể đứng ở bootloader thay vì tự chạy app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5338&quot; data-end=&quot;5386&quot;&gt;Với thiết bị thương mại, điều này rất nguy hiểm.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;5388&quot; data-end=&quot;5391&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;nb8nvb&quot; data-start=&quot;5393&quot; data-end=&quot;5420&quot;&gt;8. Mô hình đúng nên hiểu&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5422&quot; data-end=&quot;5435&quot;&gt;Thay vì hiểu:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5437&quot; data-end=&quot;5492&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Power-on → BootROM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Watchdog → Reset_Handler&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/co