        <mxCell id="AoWASO6poIcUC61nZHE8-14" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-conversation-screenshot-content=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;8ac8c1c4-4056-4fd2-8284-6d70ed6ecff0&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center justify-between&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex min-w-0 items-center&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 60px;&quot;&gt;trong trường hợp nào nên load image tuwd sd card hoặc QSPI vào ram. vì theo tôi biết dung lượng ram nhỏ hơn rất nhiều so với SD card. trong trường hợp load hết instruction vào ram thì ram có bị quá tải không?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex min-w-0 items-center&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex min-w-0 items-center&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)&quot;&gt;Thought for a couple of seconds&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; data-rtl-flip=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;icon-xs&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;cdc61528-3d78-408b-a406-8b9922dd57ca&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;242&quot;&gt;Đúng: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;6&quot; data-end=&quot;53&quot;&gt;RAM thường nhỏ hơn rất nhiều so với SD card&lt;/strong&gt;, nên hệ thống &lt;strong data-start=&quot;68&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;không load toàn bộ nội dung SD card vào RAM&lt;/strong&gt;. Nó chỉ load &lt;strong data-start=&quot;129&quot; data-end=&quot;149&quot;&gt;một image cụ thể&lt;/strong&gt;, hoặc thậm chí chỉ load &lt;strong data-start=&quot;174&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;một boot stage nhỏ&lt;/strong&gt; trước, rồi stage đó load tiếp phần cần thiết.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;Cách hiểu đúng:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;261&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SD card / QSPI Flash = nơi lưu trữ lâu dài&lt;br&gt;RAM / SRAM / DDR     = nơi chạy tạm thời&lt;br&gt;Load image           = copy một phần cần chạy vào RAM, không phải copy hết storage&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;444&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;5c32lt&quot; data-start=&quot;446&quot; data-end=&quot;490&quot;&gt;1. Có load hết instruction vào RAM không?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;Không nhất thiết.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;515&quot; data-end=&quot;534&quot;&gt;Có 3 kiểu phổ biến:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;536&quot; data-end=&quot;722&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;1. Load toàn bộ image nhỏ vào RAM rồi chạy&lt;br&gt;2. Load từng stage: BootROM → SPL → U-Boot → Linux&lt;br&gt;3. Chạy trực tiếp từ Flash/QSPI bằng XIP, chỉ copy một số đoạn cần nhanh vào RAM&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;724&quot; data-end=&quot;784&quot;&gt;Ví dụ SD card 32 GB không có nghĩa là sẽ copy 32 GB vào RAM.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;786&quot; data-end=&quot;806&quot;&gt;SD card có thể chứa:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;808&quot; data-end=&quot;1089&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SD card 32 GB&lt;br&gt;+-----------------------------+&lt;br&gt;| bootloader image: 200 KB    |&lt;br&gt;| U-Boot image: 800 KB        |&lt;br&gt;| Linux kernel: 10-30 MB      |&lt;br&gt;| device tree: vài chục KB    |&lt;br&gt;| rootfs: vài GB              |&lt;br&gt;| user data: nhiều GB         |&lt;br&gt;+-----------------------------+&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1091&quot; data-end=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;Khi boot, hệ thống chỉ load:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1183&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;bootloader nhỏ&lt;br&gt;kernel&lt;br&gt;device tree&lt;br&gt;initramfs nếu có&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1185&quot; data-end=&quot;1288&quot;&gt;Còn rootfs vài GB thường &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1210&quot; data-end=&quot;1236&quot;&gt;không load hết vào RAM&lt;/strong&gt;, mà được mount từ SD/eMMC/Flash và đọc dần khi cần.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1290&quot; data-end=&quot;1293&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;9oxaq7&quot; data-start=&quot;1295&quot; data-end=&quot;1328&quot;&gt;2. Ví dụ boot Linux từ SD card&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1330&quot; data-end=&quot;1345&quot;&gt;Flow điển hình:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1347&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Reset&lt;br&gt;  ↓&lt;br&gt;BootROM&lt;br&gt;  ↓&lt;br&gt;Load SPL/FSBL nhỏ từ SD vào internal SRAM&lt;br&gt;  ↓&lt;br&gt;SPL chạy, init DDR&lt;br&gt;  ↓&lt;br&gt;Load U-Boot vào DDR&lt;br&gt;  ↓&lt;br&gt;U-Boot chạy, load Linux kernel vào DDR&lt;br&gt;  ↓&lt;br&gt;Linux kernel chạy&lt;br&gt;  ↓&lt;br&gt;Kernel mount rootfs trên SD card&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1573&quot; data-end=&quot;1582&quot;&gt;Minh họa:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1584&quot; data-end=&quot;2268&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;SD card&lt;br&gt;+--------------------------------------+&lt;br&gt;| SPL/FSBL       ~ 100 KB              |&lt;br&gt;| U-Boot         ~ 500 KB - vài MB     |&lt;br&gt;| Linux kernel   ~ 10 - 50 MB          |&lt;br&gt;| rootfs         ~ vài trăm MB - vài GB|&lt;br&gt;| user files     rất lớn               |&lt;br&gt;+--------------------------------------+&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RAM/DDR&lt;br&gt;+--------------------------------------+&lt;br&gt;| SPL tạm thời                         |&lt;br&gt;| U-Boot                               |&lt;br&gt;| Linux kernel                         |&lt;br&gt;| device tree                          |&lt;br&gt;| runtime memory                       |&lt;br&gt;| page cache                           |&lt;br&gt;| stack/heap                           |&lt;br&gt;+--------------------------------------+&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2270&quot; data-end=&quot;2349&quot;&gt;Rootfs vẫn nằm trên SD. Linux chỉ đọc file nào cần thì lấy từ SD vào RAM/cache.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2351&quot; data-end=&quot;2354&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1sc6msd&quot; data-start=&quot;2356&quot; data-end=&quot;2394&quot;&gt;3. Tại sao phải load từ SD vào RAM?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2396&quot; data-end=&quot;2478&quot;&gt;Vì SD card là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2410&quot; data-end=&quot;2427&quot;&gt;block storage&lt;/strong&gt;, CPU không fetch instruction trực tiếp từ đó được.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2480&quot; data-end=&quot;2498&quot;&gt;CPU không thể làm:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2500&quot; data-end=&quot;2549&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.